# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Android signing keystores must never be committed -- losing control of one
# means losing the ability to publish updates to the same Play Store listing
# forever. The real one lives outside this repo entirely (see
# android/twa-manifest.json's signingKey.path); this is defense-in-depth in
# case a copy ever ends up here locally for a build.
*.keystore
*.jks
